sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Giao diện
    participant W as Ví
    participant C as Anchor Client
    participant R as RPC
    participant P as Solana Program
    UI->>C: Dữ liệu form
    C->>C: Validate + derive PDA
    C->>W: Yêu cầu ký transaction
    W->>R: Gửi transaction đã ký
    R->>P: Thực thi instruction
    P-->>R: Logs + state mới
    R-->>UI: Confirm + refetch account
